1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,818
King Kong ternyata
lahir dari Pulau Komodo!

2
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:05,278
Tahun 1926,

3
00:00:05,278 --> 00:00:07,310
petualang Amerika
Douglas Burden

4
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:10,207
membawa dua komodo hidup
ke kebun binatang New York.

5
00:00:10,207 --> 00:00:13,685
Puluhan ribu orang datang
melihat "naga" dari Komodo.

6
00:00:13,685 --> 00:00:15,419
Tapi tak lama...

7
00:00:15,419 --> 00:00:16,503
keduanya mati.

8
00:00:16,503 --> 00:00:17,399
Sahabatnya,

9
00:00:17,399 --> 00:00:19,171
pembuat film Merian Cooper,

10
00:00:19,171 --> 00:00:21,433
langsung membayangkan hal yang sama...

11
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:22,724
dengan gorila raksasa.

12
00:00:22,724 --> 00:00:23,855
Rencana awalnya?

13
00:00:23,855 --> 00:00:25,778
Gorila melawan komodo!

14
00:00:25,778 --> 00:00:27,352
Kalau kamu sutradaranya,

15
00:00:27,352 --> 00:00:29,963
tim komodo atau tim gorila?
